  "translation": "This weekend the weather was very good. My friend Xiao Ming and I wanted to go to the park. The park is east of my home, and it only takes ten minutes to walk there. We first ate breakfast at home, then set out together. On the road, I saw many flowers and trees. Inside the park it was very lively, with many people. Some were running, some were doing tai chi. Xiao Ming said, \"The weather is so good, let's go sit by the lake.\" I thought this was a good idea. At noon, we ate lunch at a small restaurant. In the afternoon, the sky became dark and it began to rain. I forgot to bring an umbrella! Xiao Ming said, \"Don't worry, I brought two umbrellas.\" We ran home at a running speed. Although our clothes got wet, we were all very happy."
